---
// 메인 헤더: 단일 H1 · 초성 검색
---
<header class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-slate-900 text-white pt-8 pb-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-indigo-900/60">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <!-- 상단 내비게이션 -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-5 mb-6 border-b border-slate-800/80 text-xs">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-left">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-md">🛡️</span>
        <div>
          <span class="font-extrabold text-base text-white tracking-tight block leading-none">웹사이트가이드 <span class="text-indigo-400 font-mono text-xs">WebsiteGuide</span></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">분야별 공식 웹사이트 안내</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="주요 메뉴" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-slate-300 font-semibold">
        <a href="#section-directory" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">📂 분야별 디렉터리</a>
        <a href="#section-verification" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">🧭 안전 접속 가이드</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">📝 블로그</a>
        <a href="/internet-of-things/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">📡 IoT 가이드</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">ℹ️ 소개</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
      자주 찾는 웹사이트의 공식 주소, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-emerald-400">분야별로 한 번에</span> 찾으세요
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      검색·공공·금융·OTT·AI 도구 등 <strong class="text-white">12개 분야 360곳</strong>의 공식 웹사이트를 운영 주체, 비용, 가입 조건과 함께 정리했습니다. 사칭 사이트 대신 공식 주소로 바로 이동하세요.
    </p>

    <!-- 검색 -->
    <div class="mt-7 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left">
      <label for="chosung-search-input" class="sr-only">사이트 이름 또는 초성 검색</label>
      <div class="relative flex items-center bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-1.5 border-2 border-indigo-400/40 focus-within:border-indigo-400 transition-all">
        <span class="pl-3.5 pr-2 text-slate-400 text-lg select-none" aria-hidden="true">🔍</span>
        <input
          type="search"
          id="chosung-search-input"
          placeholder="초성 또는 키워드 즉시 검색 (예: ㅈㅂ24 → 정부24, ㅊㅈㅍㅌ → ChatGPT, ㄴㅍㄹㅅ → 넷플릭스)"
          aria-label="사이트 이름 또는 초성 검색"
          class="w-full py-2.5 px-2 text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium focus:outline-none bg-transparent"
          autocomplete="off"
        />
        <button type="button" id="btn-clear-search" class="hidden px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 font-bold" aria-label="검색어 지우기">✕</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-trigger-search" class="px-4 sm:px-5 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold rounded-xl shadow transition-colors shrink-0">
          초성 검색
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Chosung Pills -->
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium mr-1">⚡ 초성 퀵필터:</span>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="ㅈㅂ24" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-indigo-600 border border-slate-700 font-mono transition-colors">ㅈㅂ24 (정부24)</button>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="ㅊㅈㅍㅌ" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-indigo-600 border border-slate-700 font-mono transition-colors">ㅊㅈㅍㅌ (ChatGPT)</button>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="ㄴㅍㄹㅅ" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-indigo-600 border border-slate-700 font-mono transition-colors">ㄴㅍㄹㅅ (넷플릭스)</button>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="ㄱㅅㅊㅎㅌㅅ" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-indigo-600 border border-slate-700 font-mono transition-colors">ㄱㅅㅊㅎㅌㅅ (홈택스)</button>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="ㅇㅂㅌ" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-indigo-600 border border-slate-700 font-mono transition-colors">ㅇㅂㅌ (업비트)</button>
        <button type="button" data-quick-query="" class="quick-query-pill px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 font-semibold transition-colors">전체해제</button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>
